\item[S2] Yegor Gorodzha, \emph{Fractional illumination and the optimal exponential rate in Hadwiger's covering conjecture} (2026), arXiv:2609.23913v1, Section 1, p. 1. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.23913v1}.
